Package: uun
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: nc-intezra <nc-intezra@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11) | python3.11 | python3.12 | python3.13
Recommends: sudo
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/nc-intezra/uun
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: universal update notifier TUI with end-of-life tracking
 One terminal UI to run updates across apt, dnf, zypper, pacman, flatpak,
 snap, Homebrew, pip, pipx, cargo, rustup and npm, and to track end-of-life
 dates for the OS, kernel, runtimes and servers using endoflife.date data.
 Suggests open-source alternatives when software is EoL with no supported
 update inbound. Themable with tmux-style config files.
 .
 Pure Python with bundled dependencies (textual, rich, pygments, ...); works
 on amd64, arm64 and armhf (Raspberry Pi OS) alike.
